Bundled model weights
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

assets/potion-retrieval-32M/ contains a static embedding model:

    potion-retrieval-32M
    Copyright (c) MinishLab
    MIT License
    https://huggingface.co/minishlab/potion-retrieval-32M

`tokenizer.json` and `config.json` are that model's files, unmodified. Its
tokenizer derives from BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5 (MIT).

`model-int8.safetensors` is the model's `embeddings` tensor quantized from f32
to int8. The quantization, its arithmetic, and the measured cost of it are
documented in assets/potion-retrieval-32M/PROVENANCE.md.

